# Copy to .env.local.
#
# Client ID of the Twitch application (dev.twitch.tv/console/apps). NOT a secret:
# it travels in the clear in the authorization URL and in every Client-Id header.
# Baking it in spares the visitor from having to create their own application:
# they click "Connect to Twitch" and authenticate with their own account.
#
# Every origin serving the app must appear in the application's "OAuth Redirect
# URLs", trailing slash included (http://localhost:5173/, Pages URL…).
#
# Left empty, the app disables sign-in and displays what to fill in.
#
# There is deliberately NO variable for the redirect URL: it is derived at run
# time from the address the page is served from. Only the list on the
# dev.twitch.tv side is configured.
VITE_TWITCH_CLIENT_ID=
